(
    title: "Surf\'s Up",
    developer: Some("Chip Curry"),
    description: Some("A surfing game played by standing on the JoyBoard and leaning, so keeping your balance is most of the challenge. Two lines represent the wave; you steer a small yellow surfboard into them as they converge and hold it there to score, riding longer for a bonus until you wipe out. Each wipeout and each missed wave drains a bar that never refills."),
